{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17185","headline":"寓兴 · 权德舆","name":"寓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"弱冠无所就，百忧锺一身。\n世德既颠坠，素怀亦堙沦。\n风烟隔嵩丘，羸疾滞漳滨。\n昭代未通籍，丰年犹食贫。\n敢求庖有鱼，但虑甑生尘。\n俛首愧僮仆，蹇步羞亲宾。\n岂伊当途者，一一由中人。\n已矣勿复言，吾将问秋旻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17185.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17185","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}